          <string>spotvibe</string>
        </array>
      </dict>
    </array>
    <key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
    <string>SpotVibe needs photo access so you can set a profile picture and so event operators can add a cover photo.</string>
    <key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
    <string>SpotVibe uses the camera so you can take a profile picture or a short event video.</string>
    <key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
    <string>SpotVibe uses the microphone only when you record a short event video.</string>
    <key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
    <string>SpotVibe uses your location to show events happening near you while the app is open.</string>
    <key>NSUserNotificationsUsageDescription</key>
    <string>SpotVibe sends you alerts for new events and activity on events you follow.</string>
